    "description": "The Hotel Room Hold Management API facilitates the process of temporarily reserving hotel rooms for guests. This endpoint allows users to create holds on available rooms, ensuring that they are blocked for a specified period. Typical consumers of this API include hotel management systems and travel booking platforms that need to secure accommodations for clients before finalizing bookings. The API integrates seamlessly into existing workflows to enhance the customer experience by managing room availability efficiently.",
